# POLLY, the cheat sheet: MANUAL.md's "How do I..." table, each row pressed as written there (its words as headings
# below), and a screenshot of every page in the screen's words (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-vocabulary-design.md).
# Pages: 0 Home, 1-2 Song (3: none now), 4-5 Progression, 6 Band, 7 Groove length, 8 Sound, 9 Sound 2, 10 Mixer, 11 Mixer tone,
# 12 Effects, 13-14 Style, 15 Setup, 16 Status. White keys w0..w15 are the manual's 1..16, black keys b0..b10 its 1..11.
# Funk at 100 BPM: a bar is 2400 ms. Chords: root * 100 + CH_* (maj 0), -1 no change.
wait 300
expect page 0
shot home.png
# ---- Pick a style: on Home, turn KNOB 1
turn K1 1
expect songtext_is_Funk 1
expect tempo 100
# ---- Play a progression: hold HOME, press white key 3 (P3 goes round)
wait 1200
press HOME
wait 500
expect home_shown 1
shot home_held.png
tapkey w2
release HOME
expect mode 1
expect app_loop 3
expect tag_is_S1>P3_Fifties 1
# ---- Change the groove: hold HOME, press black key 3 (Groove B, from the next bar)
tap PLAY
wait 300
press HOME
wait 100
tapkey b2
release HOME
expect next_sect 3
wait 2600
expect sect 3
shot home_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- Write a progression: Prog "-" (KNOB 4: free), REC, PLAY, a chord a bar (C, then F), REC
turn K4 -9
expect mode 0
tap REC
expect take 1
expect tag_is_S1>new_P9 1
tap PLAY
wait 100
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 100
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 2200
key 0 down
key 4 down
key 7 down
wait 100
key 0 up
key 4 up
key 7 up
wait 1000
tap REC
wait 50
expect take 0
expect mode 1
expect app_loop 9
expect loop_bars9 2
expect loop_ch9_0 0
expect loop_ch9_4 500
expect msgtext_is_NEW_PROGRESSION_P9 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- Fix a chord: ARP, KNOB 1 (Bar) and KNOB 2 (Beat) to it, turn KNOB 3 (Root)
tap ARP
expect page 4
expect app_loop 9
turn K1 1
expect cbeat 4
expect tag_is_S1>P9 1
turn K3 1
expect loop_ch9_4 600
turn K3 -1
expect loop_ch9_4 500
# ---- Go to bar 1 beat 3: KNOB 1 (Bar) 1, KNOB 2 (Beat) 3
turn K1 -1
turn K2 2
expect cbeat 2
# ---- Delete a chord: SEL, CLEAR CHORD (the list opens on it), SEL (here: F on bar 2, then undone)
turn K1 1
turn K2 -2
tap SEL
expect list_open 1
tap SEL
expect loop_ch9_4 -1
expect msgtext_is_CHORD_CLEARED 1
wait 1100
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect loop_ch9_4 500
expect msgtext_is_UNDO_CLEAR_CHORD 1
wait 1400
shot progression.png
# ---- Lengthen a progression: ARP, SELECT to page 2, turn KNOB 1 (Length)
turn SELECT 1
expect page 5
turn K1 2
expect loop_bars9 4
shot progression2.png
# ---- Add sections to the song: HOME, SELECT (Song), a white key a section (9: P9, 3: P3, 9: P9)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
expect page 1
tapkey w8
tapkey w2
tapkey w8
expect rows 3
expect row_loop1 9
expect row_loop2 3
wait 600
shot song.png
# ---- Mute an instrument in one section only: on the Song page, its black key (1: D1; on END: the last section's)
tapkey b0
expect row_mute3 1
expect msgtext_is_D1_MUTED 1
tapkey b0
expect row_mute3 0
turn SELECT 1
expect page 2
shot song2.png
turn SELECT -1
expect page 1
# ---- Play from section 3: Song, KNOB 1 (Section) to 3, SEL (the list opens on PLAY FROM SECTION 3), SEL
turn K1 -1
expect cursor 3
tap SEL
expect list_open 1
shot song_list.png
tap SEL
wait 100
expect playing 1
expect mode 2
wait 1000
expect row 3
shot song_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- Change an instrument's sound: EDIT, ALGORITHM to it (C1), turn KNOB 1 (Sound)
tap EDIT
expect page 8
expect track 5
expect trk5_program 8
turn K1 1
expect trk5_program 9
expect msgtext_is_GROOVE_A_NOW_YOURS 1
expect songtext_is_Funk|Groove_A_(yours) 1
shot sound_yours.png
wait 1500
shot sound.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 9
shot sound2.png
turn SELECT -1
# ---- Mute an instrument: SEQ, ALGORITHM to it (D1), turn KNOB 4 (Mute; again: it plays)
tap SEQ
expect page 6
turn ALGO -4
expect track 1
wait 1400
turn K4 1
expect trk1_mute 1
expect flash_rows 1
# (the cursor, for the figure: KNOB 2 Bar 2, KNOB 3 Beat 3; the flash gone)
turn K2 1
turn K3 2
expect pcur 6
wait 600
shot band.png
wait 300
turn K4 1
expect trk1_mute 0
turn ALGO 4
expect track 5
wait 1400
# (recording an instrument: SEQ, REC, PLAY, play; REC again stops; for the manual's figure)
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tapkey 7
wait 600
tapkey 11
wait 3600
expect rec_pass 2
shot recording.png
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 1400
turn SELECT 1
expect page 7
shot groove_length.png
# ---- the other pages: Mixer (2), Effects, Style (2), Setup (2)
tap LFO
expect page 10
wait 1400
shot mixer.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 11
shot mixer_tone.png
tap FX
expect page 12
shot effects.png
tap ENV
expect page 13
shot style.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 14
shot style2.png
tap GLO
expect page 15
shot setup.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 16
shot panel.png
# ---- what fills the memory: SEQ, SEL, SELECT to MEMORY (the list's last row), SEL
tap SEQ
tap SEL
expect list_open 1
shot band_list.png
turn SELECT 9
tap SEL
expect slots_list 1
shot memory.png
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect list_open 0
# ---- Record a melody: Song page, PLAY; EDIT, ALGORITHM past C4 to M1, REC (it waits for the Intro, then counts in to
# the next bar line), play, REC
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
expect page 1
turn K1 -2
expect cursor 1
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap EDIT
turn ALGO 4
expect lead_sel 1
tap REC
wait 5000
expect recording 1
expect row 1
tapkey 7
wait 500
tapkey 11
wait 500
tapkey 14
wait 300
shot melody_rec.png
tap REC
wait 50
expect lead_notes 3
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- Undo, redo: hold HOME, press REC (undo) / PLAY (redo)
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect msgtext_is_UNDO_TAKE_M1 1
expect lead_notes 0
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
expect msgtext_is_REDO_TAKE_M1 1
expect lead_notes 3
expect playing 0
# ---- Save: SAVE
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
# ---- Back up: on a computer, tools/polly_backup.py backup (here: the simulator's backup of the same stream)
backup out:cheatsheet.plb
